## Predictions (written before the run)
- opened + irritated fires an invasion: invaders>0 at some sample in the invaded arm; the cavern count tracks the control's level rather than jumping by the invader count
- still no trigger: invaders==0 at every sample in both arms for two seasons — then the seasonal roll needs something the flags do not give (wealth, population), and E23d stays a fort-construction item

